+  <td>Actual destination product, instance, tenant and service actor are checked. A validated v2 receipt identifies the committed resource and original command.</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+  <td>Partial failure</td>
+  <td>External acceptance is durable independently of local attempt state. Cancellation, revocation and exhausted retries do not mean the destination did nothing.</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+  <td>Explicit reconciliation</td>
+  <td>Authorized receipt lookup checks the original operation without submitting a new command.</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+  <td>Scheduling</td>
