-## Frontend renderer choice
-
-The first runnable profile uses **browser-native DOM modules behind a renderer-neutral mount/dispose contract**. It does not introduce a home-grown virtual DOM. `reactWorkspace()` accepts the consumer&#x27;s real ReactDOM root factory and React element callback; React is not a core dependency. The real React integration is **not executed in this delivery**. Existing Veyviz React/Nest applications are not replaced by these reference adapters.
